{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24039","headline":"秋池独泛 · 白居易","name":"秋池独泛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧疎秋竹篱，清浅秋风池。\n一只短舫艇，一张斑鹿皮。\n皮上有野叟，手中持酒巵。\n半酣箕踞坐，自问身爲谁。\n严子垂钓日，苏门长啸时。\n悠然意自得，意外何人知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}